<title>USA: NYC Water Finance Auth ratings unaffected - S&amp;P.</title>
<headline>NYC Water Finance Auth ratings unaffected - S&amp;P.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said Friday that ratings on New York City general obligation debt, rated BBB-plus, and Municipal Water Finance Authority revenue bonds, rated A-minus, will not be affected by Thurday's court ruling.</p>
<p>The New York State Court of Appeals' ruling effectively denies the authority's ability to finance the sale of the city's water system.</p>
<p>This ruling prevents a potential erosion of the authority's financial position since $2.3 billion of debt would have been issued to finance the sale of the city's water assets to the New York City Water Board.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
